{"id": "7f187677-e770-408d-be6b-dcf3a1292f8a", "slug": "pulsegrid-technical-framework", "title": "PulseGrid - Technical Framework", "description": "Pulsegrid Technical Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"PulseGrid - Technical Framework\"\ndescription: \"Pulsegrid Technical Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF0B0B\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#FF0B0B\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"2px\"\n  control: \"2px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# PulseGrid - Technical Framework\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 19; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nPulsegrid Technical Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nPulseGrid Architecture Capabilities Telemetry Connect View Docs Initialize System optimal. 14,000+ streams processing. Purify unstructured streams. Automatically. Identify corruptions. Unify architectures. Enhance preci…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Purify unstructured streams. Automatically..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF0B0B, secondary #000000, accent #FF0B0B, background #000000, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased bg-[#000000] text-white\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>PulseGrid - Technical Framework</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden font-['Inter',sans-serif] bg-[#000000] selection:bg-[#FF0B0B]/30\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Three.js Background Container -->\n    <div id=\"webgl-bg\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Persistent 24px 45-degree Grid Background -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.03]\"\n         style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #ffffff 0px, #ffffff 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 24px);\">\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Framed Container Shell -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto min-h-screen p-[22.4px] md:p-[44.8px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center\">\n\n        <!-- Gradient Border Shell Technique Wrapper (Added Glow) -->\n        <div id=\"glow-wrapper\" class=\"relative w-full group p-[1px]\" style=\"--cursor-angle: 0deg; --proximity: 0;\">\n            <!-- Border Glow Backgrounds -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[conic-gradient(from_var(--cursor-angle),#fff,transparent_60deg,transparent_300deg,#fff)] opacity-[calc(var(--proximity)/100)] transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 blur-[12px] bg-[conic-gradient(from_var(--cursor-angle),#fff,transparent_60deg,transparent_300deg,#fff)] opacity-[calc(var(--proximity)/100)] transition-opacity duration-300\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative w-full bg-[#000000]/60 backdrop-blur-sm overflow-hidden flex flex-col border-x border-white/10\"\n                 style=\"border-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), rgba(255,255,255,0.02)) 1; min-height: 80vh;\">\n\n                <!-- Tactical Corner Bracket Decorations -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-[3px] h-[3px] border-t border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-50\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-[3px] h-[3px] border-t border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-50\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[3px] h-[3px] border-b border-l border-white/40 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-50\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-[3px] h-[3px] border-b border-r border-white/40 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-50\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Top Border High-Contrast Line -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px z-20\"\n                     style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 80%, transparent);\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Navigation -->\n                <nav class=\"relative z-20 flex items-center justify-between px-[33.6px] py-[22.4px] border-b border-white/5\">\n                    <div class=\"text-xl font-light tracking-tighter text-white flex items-center gap-[11.2px]\">\n                        PulseGrid\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-[33.6px] text-sm font-light text-neutral-400\">\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Architecture</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Capabilities</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Telemetry</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Connect</a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-[22.4px]\">\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-light text-white bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 px-[16.8px] py-[5.6px] rounded-[2px] transition-colors hidden sm:block\">View Docs</a>\n                        <button class=\"bg-white hover:bg-neutral-200 text-black text-sm font-medium px-[16.8px] py-[5.6px] rounded-[2px] transition-all duration-300\">\n                            Initialize\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </nav>\n\n                <!-- Hero Content -->\n                <section class=\"relative z-20 px-[33.6px] pt-[96px] pb-[44.8px] flex-shrink-0\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col max-w-2xl\">\n                        <!-- Status Label -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-[11.2px] mb-[22.4px] text-xs text-neutral-500 font-mono tracking-tight\">\n                            <div class=\"w-[5.6px] h-[5.6px] rounded-full bg-[#FF0B0B] animate-pulse\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 11, 11, 0.8);\"></div>\n                            System optimal. 14,000+ streams processing.\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Headline (Target for Masked Reveal) -->\n                        <h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-light tracking-tighter text-white leading-[1.05] mb-[33.6px]\">\n                            Purify unstructured streams. <br> Automatically.\n                        </h1>\n\n                        <!-- Subheadline -->\n                        <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-400 font-['JetBrains_Mono',monospace] font-light leading-relaxed mb-[44.8px] max-w-md\">\n                            Identify corruptions. Unify architectures. Enhance precision.<br>\n                            Executed in absolute real-time.\n                        </p>\n\n                        <!-- CTA -->\n                        <div>\n                            <button class=\"bg-white hover:bg-neutral-200 text-black text-sm font-medium px-[22.4px] py-[11.2px] rounded-[2px] transition-all duration-300 inline-flex items-center gap-[11.2px]\">\n                                Deploy Framework\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Visual / Animation Area -->\n                <section class=\"relative flex-grow flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden min-h-[400px]\">\n\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-4xl h-full flex items-center justify-between px-[67.2px]\">\n\n                        <!-- Left Side: Errors (High-Chroma Accents) -->\n                        <div class=\"relative w-1/3 h-full flex flex-col justify-center items-start gap-[44.8px] pt-[44.8px]\">\n\n                            <!-- Tag 1 -->\n                            <div class=\"float-item flex items-center gap-[16.8px] bg-[#000000]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-[2px] px-[16.8px] py-[11.2px] text-xs font-light text-neutral-300 relative z-20\"\n                                 style=\"transform: rotate(-4deg); margin-left: -2rem;\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-[22.4px] h-[22.4px] rounded-[2px] bg-[#FF0B0B]/10 border border-[#FF0B0B]/40 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,11,11,0.2)]\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:close-linear\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"text-[#FF0B0B]\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                Format deviation\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Tag 2 -->\n                            <div class=\"float-item flex items-center gap-[16.8px] bg-[#000000]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-[2px] px-[16.8px] py-[11.2px] text-xs font-light text-neutral-300 relative z-20\"\n                                 style=\"transform: rotate(2deg); margin-left: 2rem;\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-[22.4px] h-[22.4px] rounded-[2px] bg-[#FF0B0B]/10 border border-[#FF0B0B]/40 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,11,11,0.2)]\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:close-linear\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"text-[#FF0B0B]\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                Syntax failure\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Tag 3 -->\n                            <div class=\"float-item flex items-center gap-[16.8px] bg-[#000000]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-[2px] px-[16.8px] py-[11.2px] text-xs font-light text-neutral-300 relative z-20\"\n                                 style=\"transform: rotate(-1deg); margin-left: 0rem;\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-[22.4px] h-[22.4px] rounded-[2px] bg-[#FF0B0B]/10 border border-[#FF0B0B]/40 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,11,11,0.2)]\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:close-linear\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"text-[#FF0B0B]\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                Missing payload\n                            </div>\n\n                             <!-- Tag 4 -->\n                             <div class=\"float-item flex items-center gap-[16.8px] bg-[#000000]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-[2px] px-[16.8px] py-[11.2px] text-xs font-light text-neutral-300 relative z-20\"\n                                  style=\"transform: rotate(5deg); margin-left: 1rem;\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-[22.4px] h-[22.4px] rounded-[2px] bg-[#FF0B0B]/10 border border-[#FF0B0B]/40 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,11,11,0.2)]\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:close-linear\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"text-[#FF0B0B]\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                Type conflict\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Right Side: Cleaned (Technical White/Grey) -->\n                        <div class=\"relative w-1/2 h-full flex flex-col justify-center items-end gap-[33.6px] pt-[33.6px]\">\n\n                            <!-- Tag 1 -->\n                            <div class=\"float-item-alt flex items-center gap-[16.8px] bg-[#000000]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-[2px] px-[22.4px] py-[11.2px] text-xs font-light text-white relative z-20\"\n                                 style=\"margin-right: 4rem;\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-[22.4px] h-[22.4px] rounded-[2px] border border-white/20 bg-white/5\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-linear\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                Nulls resolved\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Tag 2 -->\n                            <div class=\"float-item-alt flex items-center gap-[16.8px] bg-[#000000]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-[2px] px-[22.4px] py-[11.2px] text-xs font-light text-white relative z-20\"\n                                 style=\"margin-right: 1rem;\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-[22.4px] h-[22.4px] rounded-[2px] border border-white/20 bg-white/5\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-linear\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                Schema verified\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Tag 3 -->\n                            <div class=\"float-item-alt flex items-center gap-[16.8px] bg-[#000000]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-[2px] px-[22.4px] py-[11.2px] text-xs font-light text-white relative z-20\"\n                                 style=\"margin-right: 6rem;\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-[22.4px] h-[22.4px] rounded-[2px] border border-white/20 bg-white/5\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-linear\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                Integrity passed\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Tag 4 -->\n                            <div class=\"float-item-alt flex items-center gap-[16.8px] bg-[#000000]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-[2px] px-[22.4px] py-[11.2px] text-xs font-light text-white relative z-20\"\n                                 style=\"margin-right: -2rem;\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-[22.4px] h-[22.4px] rounded-[2px] border border-white/20 bg-white/5\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-linear\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                Output optimized\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Tag 5 -->\n                            <div class=\"float-item-alt flex items-center gap-[16.8px] bg-[#000000]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-[2px] px-[22.4px] py-[11.2px] text-xs font-light text-white relative z-20\"\n                                 style=\"margin-right: 3rem;\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-[22.4px] h-[22.4px] rounded-[2px] border border-white/20 bg-white/5\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-linear\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"text-white\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </div>\n                                Pipeline cleared\n                            </div>\n\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // WebGL Controller: Adjusted to keep laser precisely in the middle per user request\n        window.laserController = { offset: 0.0 };\n\n        // WebGL Three.js Dual Layer: Original Background Grain + New Laser Pass\n        const initWebGLBackground = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-bg');\n            if (!container || typeof THREE === 'undefined') return;\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: false });\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n\n            // Layer 1: The Original Stepped Columns Background Shader\n            const bgMaterial = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                uniforms: {\n                    u_time: { value: 0.0 },\n                    u_resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight) }\n                },\n                vertexShader: `void main() { gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0); }`,\n                fragmentShader: `\n                    uniform float u_time;\n                    uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n\n                    float random(vec2 st) {\n                        return fract(sin(dot(st.xy, vec2(12.9898,78.233))) * 43758.5453123);\n                    }\n\n                    void main() {\n                        vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n\n                        float cols = 30.0;\n                        float stepX = floor(uv.x * cols) / cols;\n                        float wave = sin(stepX * 12.0 + u_time * 0.3) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n                        float grain = random(uv + u_time * 0.1) * 0.08;\n                        float intensity = wave * (1.0 - uv.y) * 0.12 + grain;\n\n                        // Internalized 0.5 opacity so the container can remain opaque for the laser\n                        gl_FragColor = vec4(vec3(intensity), 0.5);\n                    }\n                `,\n                transparent: true\n            });\n            const bgMesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, bgMaterial);\n            scene.add(bgMesh);\n\n            // Layer 2: The New Precise Laser Scan WebGL Effect\n            const laserMaterial = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                uniforms: {\n                    u_time: { value: 0.0 },\n                    u_resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight) },\n                    u_offset: { value: 0.0 }\n                },\n                vertexShader: `void main() { gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0); }`,\n                fragmentShader: `\n                    uniform float u_time;\n                    uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n                    uniform float u_offset;\n\n                    // Volumetric noise for smoke haze\n                    float hash(vec2 p) { return fract(sin(dot(p, vec2(12.9898, 78.233))) * 43758.5453); }\n                    float noise(vec2 p) {\n                        vec2 i = floor(p); vec2 f = fract(p);\n                        f = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\n                        return mix(mix(hash(i), hash(i + vec2(1.0, 0.0)), f.x),\n                                   mix(hash(i + vec2(0.0, 1.0)), hash(i + vec2(1.0, 1.0)), f.x), f.y);\n                    }\n                    float fbm(vec2 p) {\n                        float f = 0.0; float amp = 0.5;\n                        for(int i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n                            f += amp * noise(p); p *= 2.0; amp *= 0.5;\n                        }\n                        return f;\n                    }\n\n                    void main() {\n                        vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n                        vec2 centered = uv - 0.5;\n                        centered.x *= u_resolution.x / u_resolution.y;\n\n                        // Normalize beam distance relative to offset scan line\n                        float dist = abs(centered.x - u_offset);\n\n                        // Surgical Core\n                        float core = exp(-dist * 800.0);\n\n                        // Halo Glow with gentle pulse\n                        float pulse = sin(u_time * 4.0) * 0.15 + 0.85;\n                        float glow = exp(-dist * 80.0) * 0.6 * pulse;\n\n                        // Atmospheric drift/smoke constrained strictly to the beam axis\n                        vec2 noiseUV = vec2(centered.x * 2.5, centered.y * 2.5 - u_time * 0.3);\n                        float n = fbm(noiseUV + fbm(noiseUV + u_time * 0.2));\n                        float smokeMask = exp(-dist * 6.0);\n                        float smoke = n * smokeMask * 0.8 * pulse;\n\n                        // Colors aligned to primary accent\n                        vec3 coreColor = vec3(1.0, 0.95, 0.95);\n                        vec3 brandColor = vec3(1.0, 0.043, 0.043); // #FF0B0B\n\n                        vec3 finalColor = core * coreColor + glow * brandColor + smoke * brandColor;\n\n                        // Additive blend setup\n                        gl_FragColor = vec4(finalColor, max(max(finalColor.r, finalColor.g), finalColor.b));\n                    }\n                `,\n                transparent: true,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending,\n                depthWrite: false\n            });\n\n            const laserMesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, laserMaterial);\n            laserMesh.position.z = 0.1; // Ensure it renders above the grain backdrop\n            scene.add(laserMesh);\n\n            const handleResize = () => {\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                bgMaterial.uniforms.u_resolution.value.set(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n                laserMaterial.uniforms.u_resolution.value.set(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            };\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', handleResize);\n            handleResize();\n\n            const animate = (time) => {\n                const t = time * 0.001;\n                bgMaterial.uniforms.u_time.value = t;\n                laserMaterial.uniforms.u_time.value = t;\n                laserMaterial.uniforms.u_offset.value = window.laserController.offset;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            };\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        };\n\n        // Flashlight Cursor Effect Logic\n        const initBorderGlow = () => {\n            const wrapper = document.getElementById('glow-wrapper');\n            if (!wrapper) return;\n\n            window.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const rect = wrapper.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const x = e.clientX - rect.left;\n                const y = e.clientY - rect.top;\n                const cx = rect.width / 2;\n                const cy = rect.height / 2;\n\n                const dx = x - cx;\n                const dy = y - cy;\n                const angle = Math.atan2(dy, dx) * 180 / Math.PI + 90;\n\n                wrapper.style.setProperty('--cursor-angle', `${angle}deg`);\n\n                // Calculate proximity to edges or inside\n                const isInside = x >= 0 && x <= rect.width && y >= 0 && y <= rect.height;\n                if (isInside) {\n                    wrapper.style.setProperty('--proximity', '100');\n                } else {\n                    const distX = Math.max(0, 0 - x, x - rect.width);\n                    const distY = Math.max(0, 0 - y, y - rect.height);\n                    const dist = Math.sqrt(distX*distX + distY*distY);\n                    const proximity = Math.max(0, 100 - (dist / 4));\n                    wrapper.style.setProperty('--proximity', proximity.toString());\n                }\n            });\n\n            window.addEventListener('mouseout', (e) => {\n                if (!e.relatedTarget) {\n                    wrapper.style.setProperty('--proximity', '0');\n                }\n            });\n        };\n\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            // Initialize WebGL & Glow\n            initWebGLBackground();\n            initBorderGlow();\n\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // 1. Masked Word Reveal Animation for Hero Title on Scroll\n            const title = document.getElementById('hero-title');\n\n            function splitTextToWords(element) {\n                const nodes = Array.from(element.childNodes);\n                element.innerHTML = '';\n                nodes.forEach(node => {\n                    if (node.nodeType === 3) {\n                        const words = node.nodeValue.split(/(\\s+)/);\n                        words.forEach(word => {\n                            if (word.trim() === '') {\n                                element.appendChild(document.createTextNode(word));\n                            } else {\n                                const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                                wrapper.className = 'inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom pb-1';\n                                wrapper.innerHTML = `<span class=\"inline-block word-span transform translate-y-[120%] opacity-0\" style=\"will-change: transform, opacity;\">${word}</span>`;\n                                element.appendChild(wrapper);\n                            }\n                        });\n                    } else {\n                        element.appendChild(node.cloneNode(true));\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n\n            splitTextToWords(title);\n\n            gsap.to(\".word-span\", {\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \"#hero-title\",\n                    start: \"top 85%\"\n                },\n                y: \"0%\",\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                stagger: 0.1\n            });\n\n            // 2. Floating Animation for Tags\n            gsap.utils.toArray('.float-item').forEach((item, i) => {\n                gsap.to(item, {\n                    y: \"-=10\",\n                    rotation: \"+=0.5\",\n                    duration: 2 + Math.random(),\n                    ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                    yoyo: true,\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    delay: Math.random() * 2\n                });\n            });\n\n            gsap.utils.toArray('.float-item-alt').forEach((item, i) => {\n                gsap.to(item, {\n                    y: \"+=8\",\n                    x: \"+=3\",\n                    duration: 2.5 + Math.random(),\n                    ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                    yoyo: true,\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    delay: Math.random() * 2\n                });\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "pulsegrid-technical-framework-2.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/pulsegrid-technical-framework.jpg", "source_name": "pulsegrid-technical-framework-2-DESIGN.md", "views": 83, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T19:25:58.945994+00:00"}